# Three players: Time Walk on turn 1 gives Bot1 turn 2 (the extra turn), then the order resumes with Bot2 on turn 3 and Bot3 on
# turn 4 (CR 500.7: the extra turn is inserted, the rotation continues from the player after the one who took the turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Time Walk
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x17

[Bot3 Deck]
Swamp x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Time Walk.Cast
[T2 Bot1.Main1]
? ActivePlayer = Bot1
[T3 Bot2.Main1]
[T4 Bot3.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
ActivePlayer = Bot3
Bot1.Graveyard = Time Walk
